Copyright holders of the Rust code bundled with fastsasconvert
==============================================================

The R code in this package is copyright Tobias Kragholm, under the licence
stated in DESCRIPTION.

The package additionally bundles the Rust crates listed below, as source, in
src/rust/vendor.tar.xz. Each is redistributed under its own licence; the full
licence text of every crate ships inside that archive, in the crate's own
directory. Where a crate states no authors, cargo no longer requires the field
and upstream has not set it.

This file is generated by scripts/vendor-authors.py from the vendored tree, so
that it describes exactly what the tarball contains.

